%% Selected move preview then cancel sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User pointer
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Tools as CanvasToolPort
  participant IE as InteractionEngine
  participant Cleanup as PointerToolCleanupCoordinator
  participant ReadPort as InteractionReadPort
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Facts as FrameFactsPort
  participant SelectionFacts as SelectionFactsPort
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Frame as FrameEngine facade
  participant Capture as FrameCaptureService
  participant Ordinary as OrdinaryPaintPlanner
  participant Supplement as SelectedMoveSupplementPlanner
  participant PlanCache as OrdinaryPaintRecordCache
  participant Resolver as CanvasMoveCommitResolver
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Draft as DraftDocument
  participant Touched as TouchedSet
  participant Caches as Projection and resource caches
  participant Events as EventBuffer
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  User->>Surface: pointer down on selected movable element
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample down)
  Tools->>IE: normalized finite down sample
  IE->>IE: admit one active pointer token
  IE->>ReadPort: read selected move start facts
  ReadPort->>SelectionFacts: read selected ids and selectionRevision
  SelectionFacts-->>ReadPort: selected ids
  ReadPort->>Store: read transformable flags and document order
  Store-->>ReadPort: movable flags in document order
  ReadPort->>Spatial: hit-test down position once through spatial query APIs
  Spatial-->>ReadPort: top visible selectable element id
  ReadPort-->>IE: selected ids, movable ids, and hit-selected fact in document order
  IE->>IE: start active selected move session
  Note over IE: Session stores pointer token, sessionId, start position, selected ids, movable ids, and current preview delta.
  IE->>Preview: publish CanvasSelectedMovePreview(delta: Offset.zero)
  IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for selected move preview
  Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
  Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview

  loop pointer move samples for same token
    User->>Surface: pointer move
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample move)
    Tools->>IE: normalized finite move sample
    IE->>IE: update active selected move session delta
    IE->>Preview: replace immutable CanvasSelectedMovePreview(delta)
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision when selectedMoveDelta changes
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Preview->>Frame: request main-scene repaint only
    Frame->>Capture: capture main frame once
    Capture->>Facts: capture committed frame facts once
    Facts->>Store: read committed revision facts
    Store-->>Facts: immutable committed frame facts
    Facts-->>Capture: committed frame facts
    Capture->>SelectionFacts: capture selected ids once
    Capture->>Preview: capture CanvasSelectedMovePreview.delta once
    Capture-->>Frame: CapturedMainFrame
    Frame->>Ordinary: lookup/build ordinary paint plan
    Ordinary->>PlanCache: lookup ordinary paint plan by structural, bounds, elementVisual, viewport, and device keys
    alt ordinary paint plan cache hit
      PlanCache-->>Ordinary: ordinary committed RenderElementRecord list
    else ordinary paint plan cache miss
      Ordinary->>Spatial: query ordinary viewport candidates
      Spatial-->>Ordinary: ordinary candidate handles
      Ordinary->>Facts: resolve ordinary handles against captured revisions
      Facts->>Store: read committed row snapshots
      Store-->>Facts: ordinary committed row views
      Facts-->>Ordinary: ordinary row facts or stale rejection
      Ordinary->>PlanCache: store ordinary committed records only
    end
    Ordinary-->>Frame: ordinary committed records
    Frame->>Supplement: stage selected move supplement
    Supplement->>Supplement: filter movable selected ids from ordinary records for this frame
    Supplement->>Spatial: query selected supplement shifted by -previewDelta
    Spatial-->>Supplement: selected supplement candidate handles
    Supplement->>Facts: resolve selected supplement handles against captured revisions
    Facts->>Store: read selected row snapshots
    Store-->>Facts: selected row views or stale rejection
    alt selected row facts are current
      Facts-->>Supplement: selected row facts
      Supplement->>Supplement: build per-frame supplement records with previewDelta
    else stale selected candidate
      Facts-->>Supplement: stale candidate rejection
      Supplement->>Supplement: skip selected supplement candidate
    end
    Supplement->>Supplement: merge filtered ordinary records and supplement by orderToken
    Supplement-->>Frame: merged selected move preview records
    Note over Supplement,PlanCache: Selected supplement records are per-frame and are not stored in OrdinaryPaintRecordCache.
    Frame->>Signals: publish main repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene with selected move preview
  end

  alt same-token pointer cancel
    User->>Surface: pointer cancel
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample cancel)
    Tools->>IE: same-token cancel sample
    IE->>IE: classify active selected move as cancelled
    Note over IE,Resolver: Resolver is not called for pointer cancel.
  else mode change or interactive disabled during session
    User->>Surface: mode change or interactive=false
    Surface->>Tools: route active session cancel before disabling routing
    Tools->>IE: mode-change cancellation for active token
    IE->>IE: classify active selected move as cancelled
    Note over IE,Resolver: Resolver is not called for mode-change cancellation.
  else terminal pointer up resolved as CanvasMoveCancel
    User->>Surface: pointer up
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample up)
    Tools->>IE: same-token terminal sample
    IE->>IE: read proposedDelta from selected move session
    IE->>ReadPort: read selected move commit facts
    ReadPort->>SelectionFacts: read selected ids and selectionRevision
    SelectionFacts-->>ReadPort: selected ids
    ReadPort->>Store: read summary, moved element reads, and selected bounds
    Store-->>ReadPort: CanvasMoveCommitRequest inputs
    ReadPort-->>IE: CanvasMoveCommitRequest inputs
    IE->>Resolver: resolve(request with proposedDelta)
    Resolver-->>IE: CanvasMoveCancel(reason)
    IE->>IE: discard selected move commit intent
  end

  IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for selected move cancel
  Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(main repaint target, preview changed)
  IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear active selected move session
  IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
  Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
  Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
  Preview->>Frame: request main-scene repaint cleanup
  Frame->>Capture: capture main frame once
  Capture->>Facts: capture committed frame facts once
  Facts->>Store: read committed revision facts
  Store-->>Facts: immutable committed frame facts
  Facts-->>Capture: committed frame facts
  Capture->>SelectionFacts: capture selected ids once
  Capture->>Preview: capture CanvasNoPreview for selected move path
  Capture-->>Frame: CapturedMainFrame
  Frame->>Ordinary: lookup/build ordinary paint plan
  Ordinary->>PlanCache: lookup ordinary paint plan by structural, bounds, elementVisual, viewport, and device keys
  alt ordinary paint plan cache hit
    PlanCache-->>Ordinary: ordinary committed RenderElementRecord list
  else ordinary paint plan cache miss
    Ordinary->>Spatial: query ordinary viewport candidates
    Spatial-->>Ordinary: ordinary candidate handles
    Ordinary->>Facts: resolve ordinary handles against captured revisions
    Facts->>Store: read committed row snapshots
    Store-->>Facts: ordinary committed row views
    Facts-->>Ordinary: ordinary row facts or stale rejection
    Ordinary->>PlanCache: store ordinary committed records only
  end
  Ordinary-->>Frame: ordinary committed records
  Frame->>Ordinary: use ordinary committed records without selected move preview delta
  Note over Ordinary,PlanCache: Cleanup has no selectedMoveDelta, selected-move preview records are not stored in OrdinaryPaintRecordCache.
  Frame->>Signals: publish main repaint cleanup request
  Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene without selected move preview
  IE->>IE: return pointer runtime to idle
  IE-->>Tools: cancel handling complete

  Note over Preview,Frame: Selected move cleanup affects the main scene. It is not overlay-only cleanup.
  Note over EK,Draft: No EditKernel commit and no DraftDocument mutation.
  Note over EK,Touched: No TouchedSet, no CommitPlan, and no atomic install.
  Note over SelectionFacts,Spatial: No selection, spatial, or projection state changes.
  Note over Store: No committed document revision changes.
  Note over Caches: No projection cache eviction and no resource cache change.
  Note over Events,Signals: No action event, document state publication, or selection state publication.
  Note over Runtime,Signals: Preview cleanup publishes CanvasRuntimeState when it clears active preview.
